<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets call warrants on HSBC.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on HSBC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Friday it will issue 60 million American style call warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$220.9     PREMIUM	 9.99 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$3.758     GEARING	 6.25x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 30.MAY.97    LISTING DATE  25.JUN.97</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  26.MAR.98    PAYDATE	 23.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  4,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$235</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT AT THE OPTION OF</p>
<p>ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
